# Solemn Simulacrum {4} (2/2): "When this creature enters, you may search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the
# battlefield tapped, then shuffle." Bot1 accepts and finds the Forest: only a basic land card may be found (the Tropical Island
# is refused), and it enters tapped. "When this creature dies, you may draw a card": Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills it on turn 2 and
# Bot1 accepts, so the hand grows from two Plains to three cards.

